# Darksteel Citadel, an Artifact Land with indestructible and "{T}: Add {C}". It is played as a land (CR 305.1, a land card
# is never cast) and taps for {C}. Being an artifact, Disenchant may target it; being indestructible, "destroy" does
# nothing to it (CR 702.12b), so it stays and only the Disenchant goes to the graveyard. A Mox Pearl, an artifact that is not
# indestructible, is destroyed by the second Disenchant (the positive control of the destroying).

